, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87819,"sha256":"96c47bbe3564875b6b174ff098f20622d5526f33cac8b1075008d94ba8fcbdbd","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:54+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0057_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88659,"sha256":"9fd0f24824bbd59b6665ecd64d00bc41e0bc4eb95664b798324d86e47830ab8c","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:17+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_1614_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_1614","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88657,"sha256":"d79be738d81925c1718c1824a5eb36f2f69ea97794fec377eae1d741850f15bd","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:39+00:00"},{"f